Description: NexusOS Engineering Edition KDE Plasma desktop
 Metapackage and session defaults for the NexusOS desktop:
 .
  * pulls in KDE Plasma 6 (Wayland session), SDDM and core applications
  * makes the Nexus global theme, fonts and Konsole profile the system-wide
    defaults through a dedicated XDG configuration directory
    (/usr/share/nexusos/xdg) instead of overwriting files in /etc/xdg
  * SDDM drop-in selecting the Breeze greeter on Wayland (placeholder until
    the Nexus greeter exists)
  * Nexus Dev, Nexus Infra and Nexus AI launchers for the dock
  * the Nexus Command Center and its management agent (installed by default)
 .
 Per-user settings in ~/.config always take precedence.
